<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Mistral on Tech Insights: AI &amp; Cloud</title><link>https://shoubhikbanerjee.github.io/blog/tags/mistral/</link><description>Recent content in Mistral on Tech Insights: AI &amp; Cloud</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 22:09:50 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://shoubhikbanerjee.github.io/blog/tags/mistral/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Mistral Releases Preview of Large 4 Model with 1 Trillion Parameters</title><link>https://shoubhikbanerjee.github.io/blog/p/mistral-releases-preview-of-large-4-model-with-1-trillion-parameters/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 22:09:50 +0530</pubDate><guid>https://shoubhikbanerjee.github.io/blog/p/mistral-releases-preview-of-large-4-model-with-1-trillion-parameters/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://static.simonwillison.net/static/2026-10-06/mistral-large-4-pelican.webp" alt="Featured image of post Mistral Releases Preview of Large 4 Model with 1 Trillion Parameters" /&gt;&lt;h1 id="mistral-releases-preview-of-large-4-model-with-1-trillion-parameters"&gt;Mistral Releases Preview of Large 4 Model with 1 Trillion Parameters
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mistral released a preview of its new Mistral Large 4 model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-overview"&gt;🔍 Overview
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mistral Large 4 is described as a &amp;ldquo;1 trillion parameter, 49 billion active parameter&amp;rdquo; model. It represents a significant step up from the previous Mistral Large 3, which scored 9 on Artificial Analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-key-details"&gt;⚙️ Key Details
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parameters&lt;/strong&gt;: 1 trillion total, 49 billion active&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training hardware&lt;/strong&gt;: Cluster of 3,800 NVIDIA Grace Blackwell GPUs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasoning levels (API)&lt;/strong&gt;: &amp;ldquo;none&amp;rdquo; and &amp;ldquo;high&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scoring&lt;/strong&gt;: 38 on Artificial Analysis, just behind DeepSeek 4.1 Flash (552 B model)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comparison&lt;/strong&gt;: Improves from a score of 9 on the prior model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-performance"&gt;📊 Performance
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Reasoning Level&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Output Tokens&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;none&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;3,275&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;high&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;2,717&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &amp;ldquo;high&amp;rdquo; reasoning output looked better despite using fewer tokens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-availability"&gt;🚀 Availability
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The preview is accessible via the Mistral API.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open weights are promised to be released at the end of this month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-why-it-matters"&gt;💡 Why it matters
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mistral Large 4 brings the company back to a position only about six months behind the current frontier, offering a higher‑scoring model that is not classified as a Fable‑class model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#Mistral #Large4 #LLM #AI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Source: &lt;a class="link" href="https://simonwillison.net/2026/Oct/6/le-chonk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;Introducing Mistral Large 4: Le chonk&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>LLM Leaderboard 2026 Update Ranks Over 300 AI Models</title><link>https://shoubhikbanerjee.github.io/blog/p/llm-leaderboard-2026-update-ranks-over-300-ai-models/</link><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 22:04:55 +0530</pubDate><guid>https://shoubhikbanerjee.github.io/blog/p/llm-leaderboard-2026-update-ranks-over-300-ai-models/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://llm-stats.com/api/og/leaderboard/llm-leaderboard" alt="Featured image of post LLM Leaderboard 2026 Update Ranks Over 300 AI Models" /&gt;&lt;h1 id="llm-leaderboard-2026-update-ranks-over-300-ai-models"&gt;LLM Leaderboard 2026 Update Ranks Over 300 AI Models
